WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.169
We're not even married to
Baking It as the name.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:06.840
It could be Baketacular, 
or Bakescalibur, or...

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:07.549
That's not bad.

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:08.508
Masterbakers!

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.135
Absolutely not.

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:13.179
Welcome to Baking It.

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:17.017
One team will win the
$50,000 prize.

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:20.311
I was gonna say it's the journey
not the money.

00:00:20.311 --> 00:00:21.771
Uh oh. Ha ha!

00:00:21.771 --> 00:00:23.606
That's what my lower back tattoo says.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:27.527
I'm not gonna go so far as to say
we were born for this.

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.153
I mean, some of us were.

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:30.739
I would say having kids was the best
thing that ever happened to me

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:32.615
until this show.

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:33.658
Ha ha, really?

00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:35.285
Now this is like, my real baby.

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:36.578
You know what I mean?

00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:37.704
Yes.

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:39.748
What are you making?

00:00:39.748 --> 00:00:41.291
Pudding, three ways.

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:42.208
I did a lot of those in college.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:43.334
Pudding, three ways?

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:47.047
Now our judges are here to do what
grandmothers do best.

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.632
Judge you because they love you and
think you can do better.

00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:49.924
It's great.

00:00:49.924 --> 00:00:50.467
Delicious.

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:50.842
So good.

00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:52.802
I don't agree with you on that.

00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:53.428
I think it's undercooked.

00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:56.097
The grandchildren tell me all the time,
"Oh grandma, you shouldn't say that."

00:00:56.097 --> 00:00:57.766
And I just say, "Tough s**t."

00:00:58.975 --> 00:01:00.727
I want a cake that makes me go...

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:01.478
"What?!"

00:01:02.353 --> 00:01:03.563
And then, "Mmm!"

00:01:04.355 --> 00:01:05.815
Time to get dirty.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:10.904
I love the holidays, and that's what
baking is all about.

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:11.946
It brings people together.

00:01:13.865 --> 00:01:17.786
I could not be left alone with this cake because
I know what I do with king cakes at home.

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:18.828
We don't!

00:01:18.828 --> 00:01:20.789
Oh, what, what, what were you thinking?

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:21.372
I–

00:01:21.372 --> 00:01:21.956
What?

00:01:21.956 --> 00:01:22.582
Y-you?

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:23.291
Ah!

00:01:23.291 --> 00:01:25.001
Ha ha ha!

